# Implementation Plan: Micro-SaaS Analytics Engine & Mixpanel-Grade UI

Build a complete behavioral analytics platform (a self-hosted Mixpanel/Amplitude alternative) from the browser SDK layer to the event streaming pipeline, ClickHouse columnar storage, and a React + D3.js real-time analytics dashboard.

---

## 1. Complete System Architecture & Detailed Flow Diagrams

### Diagram 1: High-Level End-to-End Event Lifecycle

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as User on Web App
    participant SDK as Browser SDK (@quantumva23/analytics-sdk)
    participant Ingest as Node.js Ingest API (:4000)
    participant Redis as Redis Cache (:6379)
    participant Kafka as Redpanda / Kafka (:9092)
    participant Worker as BullMQ Worker (:6379)
    participant ClickHouse as ClickHouse DB (:8123)
    participant Query as Query API (:5000)
    participant Dash as React Dashboard (:5173)

    User->>SDK: Clicks button / visits page
    Note over SDK: Generates session UUID, enriches event<br/>(URL, referrer, user agent, timestamp)
    SDK->>SDK: Queues in memory (5s debounce buffer)
    
    rect rgb(20, 30, 45)
        Note over SDK,Ingest: Ingestion & Decoupling (<5ms)
        SDK->>Ingest: POST /ingest { projectKey, events: [...] }
        Ingest->>Redis: Check rate limit (INCR + EXPIRE 1s)
        Redis-->>Ingest: OK (count < 100/s)
        Ingest->>Kafka: Produce to 'analytics-raw-events'
        Ingest-->>SDK: 202 Accepted { success: true }
    end

    rect rgb(25, 40, 30)
        Note over Kafka,ClickHouse: Resilient Stream Processing
        Kafka->>Worker: Consume raw event message
        Worker->>Worker: Transform & format properties map
        Worker->>ClickHouse: Async batch INSERT into 'events' table
        Worker->>Query: Broadcast live-event via SSE emitter
    end

    rect rgb(40, 25, 40)
        Note over ClickHouse,Dash: Analytics & Visualization
        Query-->>Dash: Stream live event over SSE (/api/live)
        Dash->>Query: GET /api/overview, POST /api/funnel, GET /api/retention
        Query->>ClickHouse: Columnar Aggregations (uniq, uniqIf, dateDiff)
        ClickHouse-->>Query: Ultra-fast aggregate results (<50ms)
        Query-->>Dash: Structured JSON data
        Dash->>Dash: Render D3 Funnel, Cohort Heatmap, KPI Trends
    end
```

