### Diagram 2: Client SDK Internal Flow & Batching Logic

```mermaid
flowchart TD
    Start(["Website Loads SDK Script"]) --> Init["Analytics.init({ projectKey, flushInterval: 5000 })"]
    Init --> CheckSession{"Has valid Session ID in sessionStorage?"}
    
    CheckSession -- Yes --> RenewTTL["Extend Session TTL (+30 min)"]
    CheckSession -- No --> CreateSession["Generate crypto.randomUUID() & Set 30m TTL"]
    
    RenewTTL --> AutoPageview["Trigger Auto $pageview Event"]
    CreateSession --> AutoPageview
    
    AutoPageview --> EventQueue[("In-Memory Event Buffer []")]
    
    UserAction["User Action: Analytics.track(name, properties)"] --> CapturePayload["Enrich: Session ID, URL, Referrer, UserAgent, Timestamp"]
    CapturePayload --> EventQueue
    
    EventQueue --> TimerTrigger{"Timer 5000ms OR window.beforeunload"}
    
    TimerTrigger -- Fires --> FlushBatch["Extract batch = [...queue]; queue = []"]
    FlushBatch --> SendHTTP["POST /ingest (keepalive: true)"]
    
    SendHTTP --> HTTPResult{"HTTP 202 Success?"}
    HTTPResult -- Yes --> Done(["Batch Cleared"])
    HTTPResult -- No (Network Error) --> Requeue["queue.unshift(...batch) (Retry next cycle)"]
    Requeue --> EventQueue
```

