## 2. Audit of Existing Code vs. Missing / Broken Features

| Component | Current State | Issues / Missing Features | Action Plan |
| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |
| **SDK** | Built & published on JSR; basic session management & batching | Missing `url`, `referrer`, custom event identification, and CDN script tag loader format | Standardize schema with `sessionId`, `url`, `referrer`, `properties`, and ensure batch support in API |
| **Ingest API** | Handles single events; misses rate-limiting middleware activation; table schema missing `sessionId` and `url` | Ingest endpoint fails if SDK sends batch `{ projectKey, events: [...] }`; duplicate endpoints inside Ingest API and Query API | Enhance `POST /ingest` to handle both single and batched events; connect Redis rate limiter properly; fix schema |
| **ClickHouse Schema** | Created table without `sessionId`, `url`, `referrer` | Queries in Query API failed because of mismatched columns (`session_id` vs missing `sessionId`) | Update table schema to: `event`, `projectKey`, `workspaceId`, `sessionId`, `timestamp`, `receivedAt`, `ip`, `userAgent`, `url`, `referrer`, `properties Map(String, String)` |
| **Query API** | Minimal queries with mismatched column names; missing explorer, stats, and multi-tenant filters | Hardcoded column names caused query failures; lack of flexible time ranges (today, 7d, 30d, 90d) and property breakdowns | Overhaul query endpoints with parameterized queries, multi-range filtering, and fallback mock generator if DB is booting |
| **Dashboard UI** | Very basic prototype styling, plain cards, basic SVG trapezoid, plain table | Visual design lacks premium polish; missing Events Explorer, interactive Funnel builder with step selector, cohort curves, SDK snippet generator, and interactive real app testing playground | Rebuild frontend into a Mixpanel-grade analytics platform with rich dark/light UI, D3 diagrams, smooth animations, live explorer, and app simulator |

